    "title": "Fallen Jefferson Co undersheriff remembered; Wednesday marks 106th anniversary - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Brian Hagen ,\n15 hours ago (KAIR)--A Jefferson County Undersheriff who died in the line of duty in 1920 receives new, local recognition following efforts from the current county sheriff to see George Burnau honored on the state and national stage. Today marks the 106th anniversary of the death of Burnau who died while searching for... Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak 2",
